<title>POLAND: AMERBANK TAKES DM 12 MLN LOAN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK TAKES DM 12 MLN LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Amerykanski w Polsce (Amerbank) was granted a three-year 12 million marks loan by Austria's Centro Internationale Handelsbank AG, Amerbank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the variable interest of the loan would be based on LIBOR, but gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
